window.RP_SESSION={"id":"S-53c606bbc572","messages":[{"id":"RP-II-0163004","time":"2026-08-23T12:08:00+09:00","room":"RP II","name":"빌 그레이슨","profile":"햄 찌","identity":"reviewed","type":"dialogue","body":"\"영차...\"\n\n전에 있던 전투에서 기적의 명중률을 보여준 그레이슨. 이렇게는 안된다 싶었는지 훈련장에 모습을 드러냅니다.","characters":["P-d0f426c610da"]},{"id":"RP-II-0163005","time":"2026-08-23T12:08:00+09:00","room":"RP II","name":"빌 그레이슨","profile":"햄 찌","identity":"reviewed","type":"dialogue","body":"\"흡!\"\n\n저 멀리에서, 더미를 향해 큼직한 볼트를 쏩니다.","characters":["P-d0f426c610da"]},{"id":"RP-II-0163006","time":"2026-08-23T12:08:00+09:00","room":"RP II","name":"빌 그레이슨","profile":"햄 찌","identity":"reviewed","type":"dialogue","body":"!민첩","characters":["P-d0f426c610da"]},{"id":"RP-II-0163007","time":"2026-08-23T12:08:00+09:00","room":"RP II","name":"판정·진행 봇","profile":"《운명의 굴레》","identity":"bot","type":"bot","body":"'빌 그레이슨'의 민첩 판정 :\n[7] + [2] = [9]\n결과 : 훌륭한 성공, 운명이 당신을 이끕니다.","characters":[]},{"id":"RP-II-0163008","time":"2026-08-23T12:09:00+09:00","room":"RP II","name":"빌 그레이슨","profile":"햄 찌","identity":"reviewed","type":"dialogue","body":"-푹\n\n더미에 명중합니다.\n\n\"에잉... 그때 좀 맞지.\"","characters":["P-d0f426c610da"]},{"id":"RP-II-0163009","time":"2026-08-23T12:39:00+09:00","room":"RP II","name":"켈라","profile":"오드리","identity":"reviewed","type":"dialogue","body":"\"어이 거기 빡빡이! 시끄럽다. 대낮부터 뭘 쏘고 난리야\"","characters":["P-c9cd6b2cc1b3"]},{"id":"RP-II-0163010","time":"2026-08-23T12:42:00+09:00","room":"RP II","name":"빌 그레이슨","profile":"햄 찌","identity":"reviewed","type":"dialogue","body":"\"...?\"\n\n총이면 몰라도, 석궁이 시끄럽다고 불평하는 건 또 처음 보는 빌","characters":["P-d0f426c610da"]},{"id":"RP-II-0163011","time":"2026-08-23T12:42:00+09:00","room":"RP II","name":"빌 그레이슨","profile":"햄 찌","identity":"reviewed","type":"dialogue","body":"\"자네는 누군가?\"","characters":["P-d0f426c610da"]},{"id":"RP-II-0163012","time":"2026-08-23T12:44:00+09:00","room":"RP II","name":"켈라","profile":"오드리","identity":"reviewed","type":"dialogue","body":"\"마치 석궁이 시끄럽다니 그게 뭔 소리지 하는 표정으로 쳐다보는군? 난 켈라다. 뭐 더 궁금한건 없을거 같네.\"\n\n구릿빛 피부, 매서운 노란 눈, 검고 짧은 머리카락.\n옷은 누가봐도 무희같네요.\n\n\"넌 뭐냐, 뭔데 그렇게 큰 화살같은걸 쏘는거야?\"","characters":["P-c9cd6b2cc1b3"]},{"id":"RP-II-0163013","time":"2026-08-23T12:46:00+09:00","room":"RP II","name":"빌 그레이슨","profile":"햄 찌","identity":"reviewed","type":"dialogue","body":"\"...사수지.\"\n\n그녀의 당당한 태도에 말문이 막혀, 따질 생각은 접어놓습니다.\n\n\"우리 길드가 춤꾼도 받나?\"","characters":["P-d0f426c610da"]},{"id":"RP-II-0163014","time":"2026-08-23T12:51:00+09:00","room":"RP II","name":"켈라","profile":"오드리","identity":"reviewed","type":"dialogue","body":"\"흥, 춤꾼? 내가 춤꾼이긴하지, 그렇지만 춤만 춘다고 뽑혔으면 개나소나 뽑혔겠지?\n\n그러고는 자신의 부채를 건냅니다.\n\n\"내 무기야.\"\n\n부채의 대 끝부분에는 정교하고 날카로운 칼날이 빽빽하게 박혀있네요","characters":["P-c9cd6b2cc1b3"]},{"id":"RP-II-0163015","time":"2026-08-23T12:55:00+09:00","room":"RP II","name":"빌 그레이슨","profile":"햄 찌","identity":"reviewed","type":"dialogue","body":"\"하긴, 개나소나 뽑진 않겠지.\"\n\n그녀의 무기를 보고는 끄덕, 한다.","characters":["P-d0f426c610da"]},{"id":"RP-II-0163016","time":"2026-08-23T12:55:00+09:00","room":"RP II","name":"빌 그레이슨","profile":"햄 찌","identity":"reviewed","type":"dialogue","body":"\"신기한 무기구만.\"","characters":["P-d0f426c610da"]},{"id":"RP-II-0163017","time":"2026-08-23T12:57:00+09:00","room":"RP II","name":"켈라","profile":"오드리","identity":"reviewed","type":"dialogue","body":"\"그렇제? 아주 정교하고, 또 멀리서 보면 장식 같기도 하지. 사람 하나 없어져도 나인건 눈치채기 힘들기도하고.\"","characters":["P-c9cd6b2cc1b3"]},{"id":"RP-II-0163018","time":"2026-08-23T12:58:00+09:00","room":"RP II","name":"빌 그레이슨","profile":"햄 찌","identity":"reviewed","type":"dialogue","body":"\"아무래도... 정비를 자주 해줘야겠구만. 오래 쓸 정도로 내구성이 뛰어나보이지는 않는걸.\"","characters":["P-d0f426c610da"]},{"id":"RP-II-0163019","time":"2026-08-23T13:02:00+09:00","room":"RP II","name":"켈라","profile":"오드리","identity":"reviewed","type":"dialogue","body":"\"부채 자체가 오래 쓸 물건은 아니지. 무엇보다 디자인이 금방 질린다고.\"\n\n촤락 부채를 펼치니 민무늬, 꽤 수수해 보이는 생김새입니다.\n\n\"그래서 난 부채마다 칼날을 달아, 디자인별로\"","characters":["P-c9cd6b2cc1b3"]},{"id":"RP-II-0163020","time":"2026-08-23T13:04:00+09:00","room":"RP II","name":"빌 그레이슨","profile":"햄 찌","identity":"reviewed","type":"dialogue","body":"\"허... 주문제작일 줄 알았는데 신기하구먼.\"","characters":["P-d0f426c610da"]},{"id":"RP-II-0163021","time":"2026-08-23T13:04:00+09:00","room":"RP II","name":"켈라","profile":"오드리","identity":"reviewed","type":"dialogue","body":"\"그거야 당연히 주문제작이지~\"","characters":["P-c9cd6b2cc1b3"]},{"id":"RP-II-0163022","time":"2026-08-23T13:05:00+09:00","room":"RP II","name":"빌 그레이슨","profile":"햄 찌","identity":"reviewed","type":"dialogue","body":"\"헌데 그럴거면 뼈대와 칼날을 튼튼하게 만들고, 무늬가 새겨진 종이 부분만 갈아끼우면 되는 것 아니오?\"","characters":["P-d0f426c610da"]},{"id":"RP-II-0163023","time":"2026-08-23T13:05:00+09:00","room":"RP II","name":"켈라","profile":"오드리","identity":"reviewed","type":"dialogue","body":"\"부채는 모든 부분이 예술이어야해, 조금이라도 어울리지 않으면? 질리기 마련이지, 뭐 물론 이 부채만 쓰라도 돈준다면 계속 쓰겠지만\"","characters":["P-c9cd6b2cc1b3"]},{"id":"RP-II-0163024","time":"2026-08-23T13:07:00+09:00","room":"RP II","name":"빌 그레이슨","profile":"햄 찌","identity":"reviewed","type":"dialogue","body":"\"뭐... 그렇구만...\"","characters":["P-d0f426c610da"]},{"id":"RP-II-0163025","time":"2026-08-23T13:07:00+09:00","room":"RP II","name":"빌 그레이슨","profile":"햄 찌","identity":"reviewed","type":"dialogue","body":"이해하기를 포기한 빌","characters":["P-d0f426c610da"]},{"id":"RP-II-0163026","time":"2026-08-23T13:09:00+09:00","room":"RP II","name":"켈라","profile":"오드리","identity":"reviewed","type":"dialogue","body":"\"쳇, 이해를 못하는 모양이군?\"","characters":["P-c9cd6b2cc1b3"]},{"id":"RP-II-0163027","time":"2026-08-23T13:09:00+09:00","room":"RP II","name":"빌 그레이슨","profile":"햄 찌","identity":"reviewed","type":"dialogue","body":"\"예술이랑은 거리가 멀어서 말이지.\"","characters":["P-d0f426c610da"]},{"id":"RP-II-0163028","time":"2026-08-23T13:09:00+09:00","room":"RP II","name":"켈라","profile":"오드리","identity":"reviewed","type":"dialogue","body":"\"부채는 예술이지만. 내 춤은 예술이 아냐.\"","characters":["P-c9cd6b2cc1b3"]},{"id":"RP-II-0163029","time":"2026-08-23T13:10:00+09:00","room":"RP II","name":"빌 그레이슨","profile":"햄 찌","identity":"reviewed","type":"dialogue","body":"\"몸치인가?\"","characters":["P-d0f426c610da"]},{"id":"RP-II-0163030","time":"2026-08-23T13:10:00+09:00","room":"RP II","name":"켈라","profile":"오드리","identity":"reviewed","type":"dialogue","body":"\"내가? 허! 이상한 소릴, 예술을 위해 춤추지 않는다는거야.\"","characters":["P-c9cd6b2cc1b3"]},{"id":"RP-II-0163031","time":"2026-08-23T13:15:00+09:00","room":"RP II","name":"빌 그레이슨","profile":"햄 찌","identity":"reviewed","type":"dialogue","body":"\"어... 그러면?\"","characters":["P-d0f426c610da"]},{"id":"RP-II-0163032","time":"2026-08-23T13:16:00+09:00","room":"RP II","name":"켈라","profile":"오드리","identity":"reviewed","type":"dialogue","body":"\"...\"","characters":["P-c9cd6b2cc1b3"]},{"id":"RP-II-0163033","time":"2026-08-23T13:16:00+09:00","room":"RP II","name":"켈라","profile":"오드리","identity":"reviewed","type":"dialogue","body":"\"돈이지.\"","characters":["P-c9cd6b2cc1b3"]},{"id":"RP-II-0163034","time":"2026-08-23T13:18:00+09:00","room":"RP II","name":"빌 그레이슨","profile":"햄 찌","identity":"reviewed","type":"dialogue","body":"\"...\"","characters":["P-d0f426c610da"]},{"id":"RP-II-0163035","time":"2026-08-23T13:19:00+09:00","room":"RP II","name":"빌 그레이슨","profile":"햄 찌","identity":"reviewed","type":"dialogue","body":"\"크 크흠\"","characters":["P-d0f426c610da"]},{"id":"RP-II-0163036","time":"2026-08-23T13:27:00+09:00","room":"RP II","name":"켈라","profile":"오드리","identity":"reviewed","type":"dialogue","body":"\"그냥 그렇다고.\"","characters":["P-c9cd6b2cc1b3"]},{"id":"RP-II-0163037","time":"2026-08-23T13:28:00+09:00","room":"RP II","name":"빌 그레이슨","profile":"햄 찌","identity":"reviewed","type":"dialogue","body":"\"뭐, 그럴 수 있지.\"","characters":["P-d0f426c610da"]},{"id":"RP-II-0163038","time":"2026-08-23T13:28:00+09:00","room":"RP II","name":"빌 그레이슨","profile":"햄 찌","identity":"reviewed","type":"dialogue","body":"\"그래서 춤이 돈은 되더나?\"","characters":["P-d0f426c610da"]},{"id":"RP-II-0163039","time":"2026-08-23T13:28:00+09:00","room":"RP II","name":"켈라","profile":"오드리","identity":"reviewed","type":"dialogue","body":"\"여튼 시끄럽게 연습할거면 돈내.\"","characters":["P-c9cd6b2cc1b3"]},{"id":"RP-II-0163040","time":"2026-08-23T13:29:00+09:00","room":"RP II","name":"빌 그레이슨","profile":"햄 찌","identity":"reviewed","type":"dialogue","body":"\"여긴 원래 이런거 하라고 있는 훈련장이네만...\"","characters":["P-d0f426c610da"]},{"id":"RP-II-0163041","time":"2026-08-23T13:29:00+09:00","room":"RP II","name":"켈라","profile":"오드리","identity":"reviewed","type":"dialogue","body":"\"...알아서 해.\"","characters":["P-c9cd6b2cc1b3"]},{"id":"RP-II-0163042","time":"2026-08-23T17:35:00+09:00","room":"RP II","name":"켈라","profile":"오드리","identity":"reviewed","type":"dialogue","body":"-fin","characters":["P-c9cd6b2cc1b3"]},{"id":"RP-II-0163043","time":"2026-08-23T17:35:00+09:00","room":"RP II","name":"판정·진행 봇","profile":"《운명의 굴레》","identity":"bot","type":"bot","body":"-fin","characters":[]}]};
